				<wikidot:authorName>Rounderhouse</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4187885</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I'm inclined to agree with Nico. I went through most of this expecting Cappi to be some baby Kaiju that was gonna go absolutely ape once Croco came back, but I came out just kind of&#8230; confused? Like, nothing actually happens - the only conflict is in the last bit and.. a giant fly dies? It just felt very&#8230; pointless to me, nothing meaningful changes (which I understand this is a prologue, but even in the context of Cappi, there is no meaningful change to her from the start of this article to the end).</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
